  "label": "internet meme culture audience",
  "description": "The target community is individuals familiar with internet meme culture, particularly those who appreciate dark humor, irony, and shock-value content. The meme relies on the juxtaposition of mundane visuals (men walking) with graphic imagery (fatal accident) to create a comedic or ironic effect, which is a common trope in online humor communities. The audience is expected to understand the meme’s setup and punchline through cultural context rather than literal interpretation.",
